os-pc: pkg-config files for libraries that the MINIX base system ships
without one (expat 2.1.0, zlib 1.2.3), so ports find them with
dependency()/PKG_CHECK_MODULES.  Installed into /usr/pkg/lib/pkgconfig;
they describe /usr/include and /usr/lib of the OS (the cross pkg-config
prefixes the sysroot).
